-- 65. 修改 LBAC 安全策略并验证策略行为；本语句预期失败，需核对 SQLSTATE 及错误原因
ALTER SECURITY POLICY lblbacnew011_p USE ROLE AUTHORIZATIONS USE ROLE AUTHORIZATIONS;
<<SQLSTATE;

